                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I got this for free in 2015 and decided to finally give it a try. It's not terrible, but there are far better 2D puzzle platformers out there (Ori and the Blind Forest, Gris, Little Nightmares, INSIDE, Animal Well). The puzzles are mostly trial-and-error, the soundtrack is unremarkable, and the artstyle is meh.\n\nTechnical info: There is no Steam Cloud support. The game speed is tied to the framerate, so make sure to limit your monitor to 60 Hz or otherwise cap your fps. The server for the community-made levels has also apparently been defunct for several years, making at least one of the achievements unattainable without setting up a [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2882031791]local server[/url].",
